cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use gwsonify in teaching materials, outreach or publications, please cite it
  as below. Please also acknowledge GWOSC (https://gwosc.org/acknowledgement/) and cite
  the data release and catalog papers for the events you use; each output's
  *.provenance.json lists the event DOI.
title: "gwsonify: hear gravitational waves from GWOSC data"
